<section class="desk-card"><h2>Publication evidence</h2><p>Completed posts have a recorded publication URL. Accepted, scheduled and assisted posts are not counted as completed delivery.</p>
<div class="desk-table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Account</th><th>Scheduled (Nairobi)</th><th>Status</th><th>Published post</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($report as$j):?><tr><td><?=e($j['name'])?></td><td><?=e(publishing_local_time($j['scheduled_at']))?></td><td><?=e(ucfirst(str_replace('_',' ',$j['status'])))?></td><td><?php if($j['status']==='published'&&!empty($j['external_url'])):?><a href="<?=e($j['external_url'])?>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View actual post ↗</a><?php else:?>Not yet confirmed<?php endif;?></td></tr><?php endforeach;?></tbody></table></div>
<?php if(!$report):?><p class="desk-note">No delivery jobs yet.</p><?php endif;?><p class="desk-note">Sales, completed applications and reach are not inferred from publication. Platform analytics remain subject to the connected provider’s available permissions.</p></section>
